]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids in Mahaska County came in under 90% of normal in November to December in 39 of the 75 years from 1951 to 2025. On the middle, January to February 2025 ran 44% of normal and August to September 2025 ran 48%, but June to July 2025 hit 170%. Grid 25950 had its driest year in 1988 at 49% of normal.</p>"}
